18
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.900
I know you're furious, but I really

19
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.100
missed you these past few days.

20
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.660
Get out.

21
00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:54.460
Elora, don't kick him out just yet.

22
00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:57.100
Chase says he actually wants to help us this time.

23
00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.420
Help?

24
